@startuml Phase11_Control_Algorithm

!theme plain
title Phase 11 適応制御アルゴリズム詳細

' === 制御ループ詳細 ===

participant "Camera Thread" as CT
participant "Frame Size Analyzer" as FSA
participant "Multi-Variable Controller" as MVC
participant "Adaptive PID" as APID
participant "Predictive Control" as PC
participant "Buffer Manager" as BM

== 制御サイクル (100ms周期) ==

CT -> FSA : frame_data, size, timestamp
activate FSA

FSA -> FSA : update_size_statistics()
note right : 直近10フレームの\nサイズ統計を更新

FSA -> FSA : calculate_complexity_index()
note right : シーン複雑度指数\n= size_variance / avg_size

FSA -> PC : size_trend, complexity_index
activate PC

PC -> PC : predict_next_frame_size()
note right : 線形回帰による\nサイズ予測

PC -> PC : estimate_queue_impact()
note right : 予測サイズから\nキュー影響を推定

PC --> MVC : predicted_load
deactivate PC

FSA --> MVC : current_stats
deactivate FSA

' キュー深度取得
CT -> MVC : current_queue_depth

' 制御計算
activate MVC

MVC -> MVC : normalize_input_vector()
note right : 入力正規化:\nqueue_depth, avg_size,\nvariance, transmission_time

MVC -> APID : control_vector
activate APID

APID -> APID : adapt_gains()
note right : 複雑度に応じてゲイン調整:\nif complexity > threshold:\n  Kp *= 0.8, Ki *= 0.5

APID -> APID : pid_calculation()
note right : 拡張PID計算:\nP = Kp * error\nI = Ki * ∫error dt\nD = Kd * derror/dt

APID --> MVC : fps_adjustment
deactivate APID

MVC -> BM : buffer_recommendation
activate BM

BM -> BM : calculate_optimal_buffer_size()
note right : 統計に基づく\n動的バッファサイズ計算

BM --> MVC : buffer_config
deactivate BM

MVC --> CT : fps_output, buffer_size
deactivate MVC

CT -> CT : apply_fps_change()
CT -> CT : apply_buffer_resize()

== 異常検出・フォールバック ==

alt 制御不安定検出
  MVC -> MVC : stability_check()
  note right : 出力振動、発散検出

  MVC -> "Safety Fallback" : trigger_fallback()

  "Safety Fallback" -> "Original PID" : revert_to_phase10()
  note right : Phase 10制御に復帰
end

@enduml